                                                Click="OnHelpButtonClicked"
                                                CommandParameter="Universal Trigger Editor"
                                                Tag="{loc:Translate 'Universal Triggers are global Twitch-to-OSC actions. They do not belong to Avatar Sets. For managed channel-point rewards, Crystal Relay checks the current avatar local OSC file and only shows the reward when that avatar has at least one matching avatar parameter action.'}" />
